---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const articleSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      "@id": "https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-rivenza-rera-possession-milestones-escrow/#article",
      "headline": "Mahindra Rivenza MahaRERA Compliance, Possession Milestones & Escrow Security",
      "description": "Exhaustive legal and regulatory evaluation of Mahindra Rivenza by Mahindra Lifespaces at Baner Annex (Mahalunge), Pune. Verifies MahaRERA numbers PR1261012602102 and PM1261012602103, statutory 70% escrow accounts, and handover timelines.",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Pune Real Estate Legal & Regulatory Desk"
      },
      "publisher": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "Mahindra Rivenza"
      },
      "datePublished": "2026-10-21",
      "dateModified": "2026-10-21"
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-rivenza-rera-possession-milestones-escrow/#faq",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What are the official MahaRERA registration numbers for Mahindra Rivenza?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Mahindra Rivenza holds two registered phase certificates from the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority: Phase 1 is registered under MahaRERA No. PR1261012602102, and Phase 2 is registered under MahaRERA No. PM1261012602103. Both registrations can be independently verified on the official MahaRERA portal (maharera.maharashtra.gov.in)."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How does the MahaRERA 70% escrow account protect homebuyer funds at Mahindra Rivenza?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Under Section 4(2)(l)(D) of the RERA Act, 70% of all funds collected from homebuyers must be deposited into a dedicated scheduled bank escrow account. These funds can only be withdrawn in proportion to the percentage of construction completion, verified and certified by the project architect, structural engineer, and chartered accountant."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout
  title="Mahindra Rivenza MahaRERA Compliance, Milestones & Escrow"
  description="Exhaustive regulatory analysis of Mahindra Rivenza: MahaRERA PR1261012602102 & PM1261012602103, 70% escrow account security, and possession milestones."
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/articles/mahindra-rivenza-rera-possession-milestones-escrow/"
  customSchema={articleSchema}
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-charcoal-950 text-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">
      
      <!-- Article Header -->
      <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs text-gold-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
          <a href="/articles/" class="hover:underline">← All Research</a>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>Legal &amp; Regulatory Compliance</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>October 2026 Edition</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-100 leading-tight">
          Mahindra Rivenza MahaRERA Compliance, Possession Milestones &amp; Escrow Security
        </h1>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-400 font-light leading-relaxed">
          In real estate investments, developer credibility and regulatory transparency are the supreme determinants of financial safety. Below is an exhaustive legal breakdown of Mahindra Rivenza’s statutory registration under MahaRERA, its escrow banking mechanisms, and its construction delivery milestones at Baner Annex (Mahalunge), Pune.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Body -->
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">1. Official MahaRERA Registration Dossier</h2>
        <p>
          Mahindra Rivenza has obtained formal sanction and registration from the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority (MahaRERA):
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-6">
          <div class="p-6 bg-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/30 rounded-2xl space-y-3">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-gold-500/10 text-gold-400 text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase">Phase 1 Registration</span>
            <div class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Mahindra Rivenza Phase 1</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-mono text-gold-300 font-bold">MahaRERA: PR1261012602102</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">
              Valid through December 30, 2031. Covers Phase 1 residential towers, podium infrastructure, and signature central clubhouse zone.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 bg-charcoal-900 border border-gold-500/30 rounded-2xl space-y-3">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-gold-500/10 text-gold-400 text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase">Phase 2 Registration</span>
            <div class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Mahindra Rivenza Phase 2</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-mono text-gold-300 font-bold">MahaRERA: PM1261012602103</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400">
              Valid through December 30, 2031. Covers Phase 2 sky residence towers and complementary biophilic landscaped recreation corridors.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">2. The 70% Statutory Escrow Banking Mechanism</h2>
        <p>
          The most powerful safeguard for homebuyers under MahaRERA Section 4(2)(l)(D) is the compulsory separate escrow account. At Mahindra Rivenza:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-stone-300">
          <li><strong>No Fund Diversion:</strong> Exactly 70% of every rupee paid by a homebuyer is routed directly into an isolated project escrow account with a scheduled commercial bank. Funds cannot be diverted to acquire other land parcels or finance other developments.</li>
          <li><strong>Three-Tier Architect &amp; CA Certification:</strong> Withdrawals from the escrow account can only be executed after formal certificates are signed by an independent project architect (certifying physical progress), a structural engineer (certifying structural safety), and a practicing chartered accountant (certifying financial proportion).</li>
          <li><strong>MahaRERA Quarterly Compliance Filings:</strong> The developer uploads audited quarterly progress reports (QPR) on the MahaRERA portal detailing unit sales, cash receipts, and construction milestones.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">3. Clear Land Title &amp; Zero Encumbrance Certification</h2>
        <p>
          Mahindra Lifespace Developers Limited acquired the ~13.46-acre land parcel at Mahalunge / Baner Annex with 100% freehold, unencumbered land title. The title search report and legal non-encumbrance certificate issued by senior legal advocates are publicly downloadable on the MahaRERA verification portal.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">4. On-Site Show Residence Experience</h2>
        <p>
          Prospective homebuyers and NRI investors are invited to inspect the fully furnished on-site 4 BHK show home at the sales gallery located off Baner-Hinjawadi Road, Pune - 412115. This allows buyers to physically verify carpet clearances, ceiling heights, door-window frame materials, and the biophilic cross-ventilation design firsthand prior to booking.
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- Action Box -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-charcoal-900 via-charcoal-800 to-charcoal-900 border border-gold-400/30 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-gold-400 tracking-widest font-bold">RERA &amp; Project Verification Desk</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white">Schedule On-Site Show Home Walkthrough</h3>
          <p class="text-stone-300 text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-xl">
            Book a private walkthrough of the 4 BHK show residence and verify sanctioned MahaRERA architectural CAD layouts with our compliance team.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a
            href="tel:+917744009295"
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-400 text-charcoal-950 font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-lg text-center"
          >
            Call Desk: +91 7744009295
          </a>
          <a
            href="/rera/"
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-lg bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 border border-white/20 text-white font-medium text-sm transition-all text-center"
          >
            View Official RERA Hub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
